{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDE5L0Nob2lyJTIwR2lybCUyMCUyODIwMTklMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Choir Girl","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/vvP9KS79EfLEKMHFr7clB69qFRQ.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kBMxs72kwWJeN5lgXvxcQoqEzFf.jpg","description":"CHOIR GIRL is a gritty drama about a lonely photographer, Eugene, who becomes obsessed with an underage prostitute, Josephine, in his rundown neighbourhood. She has escaped a worn-torn country only to be trapped in the illegal sex trade by corruption and a powerful underworld criminal named Daddy. Yet for Eugene, Josephine represents a symbol of purity in the darkness - when he takes her photograph there is something captivating about her and she quickly becomes his muse.","releaseInfo":"2019","genres":["Drama","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"3.0","runtime":"90 min","cast":["Peter Flaherty","Krista Vendy","Jack Campbell","Kym Valentine","Andy McPhee","Roger Ward","Sarah Timm","Lee Mason"],"director":["John Fraser"],"released":"2019-12-05T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"His inspiration is more than you can handle.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Peter Flaherty","character":"Eugene","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jInoktttmAFRxFy9zIY45Hym5Mn.jpg"},{"name":"Krista Vendy","character":"Polly"},{"name":"Jack Campbell","character":"Daddy","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/egJT6j0NHfVYEeC4WYVfiiF8589.jpg"},{"name":"Kym Valentine","character":"Caroline Doyle","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/hIBvXAnktA9nnK5TkJrx071m76Q.jpg"},{"name":"Andy McPhee","character":"Mikhail","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/uC0QWuaaOoIcLl6f5ebkFgTyF1r.jpg"},{"name":"Roger Ward","character":"William Millard","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/1ABctS3WpNwqlSzytPwudMSrIge.jpg"},{"name":"Sarah Timm","character":"Josephine"},{"name":"Lee Mason","character":"Julius"},{"name":"Jillian Murray","character":"Anne","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/zkt2X0